WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Let's put Claude on Windows.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.500
Go to claude.com/download and click Windows.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Run the installer, then open Claude.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Sign up or sign in — the code comes by email.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.500
New project named Inbox. Paste your helper instructions.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Your trainer takes it from there.
